# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client data is deliberately NOT tracked.
#
# This tool is developed against issued Origin drawings, Origin internal
# standards and marked-up outputs. None of that is ours to publish, so the
# repository carries the tool only. See README "Getting the data" for what to
# put back to run the tests.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
reference/
origin standards/
samples/
output/
ErrorReports/

